---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Dark Energy Observations Cheat Sheet | Free SNe Ia, BAO, CMB"
  description="Complete dark energy observations cheat sheet with SNe Ia, BAO, and CMB. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Dark Energy Observations<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>SNe Ia, BAO, and CMB. Evidence for accelerating expansion.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Type Ia Supernovae</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Standard Candles</h3>
        <pre><code>Fixed luminosity: M_V ≈ -19.3
Phillips relation: brighter = slower
Distance modulus: μ = m - M = 5 log(d/10)
Luminosity distance: d_L = 10^(μ/5 + 1) Mpc</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Discovery</h3>
        <pre><code>1998: two teams found acceleration
Perlmutter (Supernova Cosmology Project)
Riess et al. (High-z Supernova Team)
Nobel Prize 2011</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Baryon Acoustic Oscillations</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>BAO Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Sound horizon: ~ 150 Mpc
Standard ruler: fixed physical scale
Imprints on galaxy clustering
Measures expansion history
Complementary to CMB</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>CMB Constraints</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>CMB Parameters</h3>
        <pre><code>Ω_total ≈ 1 (flat universe)
Ω_m ≈ 0.32 (matter)
Ω_Λ ≈ 0.68 (dark energy)
From peak positions and heights</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Combined Constraints</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Parameter Space</h3>
        <pre><code>w = -1.03 ± 0.03 (Planck + SNe)
Ω_Λ = 0.685 ± 0.007 (Planck 2018)
H₀ = 67.4 ± 0.5 km/s/Mpc (Planck)
Tension: local H₀ measurements differ</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
